WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.005
That gold-coin storm over there? The news calls it a 'growth spurt.' A graphics-card company just did 133 trillion won in a quarter — double last year.

00:00:10.005 --> 00:00:17.023
That's right! Your rent is my revenue, and my revenue is the whole storm!

00:00:17.023 --> 00:00:27.028
Hold on — 'growth spurt'? That's a toddler word. Including me.

00:00:27.028 --> 00:00:32.041
The storm popped — and left exactly one invoice behind.

00:00:32.041 --> 00:00:40.041
When a kid grows, mom buys new clothes. So this is my new outfit.

00:00:40.041 --> 00:00:45.054
A-ah, but that's the 133-trillion invoice!!

00:00:45.054 --> 00:00:54.056
The cards are ours now. The growth isn't somebody's revenue — it's our asset.

00:00:54.056 --> 00:00:59.978
I'm four, so the asset is candy. Hand it over.

00:00:59.978 --> 00:01:03.058
THE GATE IS UNDER MY WATCH!

